# Audit captures. The measurement harness in mobile-audit/a11y is tracked
# because it is re-runnable evidence; the PNGs it produces are ~31MB of
# full-DPR renders and are regenerated by `capture.mjs` / `multi.mjs` in a
# few seconds. Same reason `shots/` is ignored. The JSON results ARE
# tracked — they are the numbers, and they are small.
mobile-audit/**/*.png
